{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":28},"timestamp":1787499831,"command":"scripts/demo.sh","title":"Quirl tour","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.023, "o", "Quirl - a well-stirred shell\r\nThe three prompt modes make bytes, typed values, and intent visibly different.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nNORMAL MODE — run familiar programs; Quirl owns pipes and process status.\r\n"]
[4.006, "o", "\r\n> exec printf 'api ready\\nworker degraded\\n' | grep degraded && printf 'pipeline status: healthy\\n'\r\n"]
[0.080, "o", "worker degraded\r\npipeline status: healthy\r\n\r\n"]
[4.012, "o", "\r\nCOMPLETION — learn flags from the same catalog that powers help and docs.\r\n"]
[4.011, "o", "\r\n> complete git commit --am\r\n"]
[0.050, "o", "--amend                      Replace the tip of the current branch\r\n"]
[4.018, "o", "\r\nDATA MODE — filter and sort real typed fields before rendering a table.\r\n"]
[4.017, "o", "\r\n> data [{\"service\":\"api\",\"region\":\"eu\",\"latency_ms\":18},{\"service\":\"worker\",\"region\":\"us\",\"latency_ms\":91},{\"service\":\"jobs\",\"region\":\"eu\",\"latency_ms\":54}] | where latency_ms > 50 | sort latency_ms desc | select service region latency_ms\r\n"]
[0.038, "o", "service\tregion\tlatency_ms\r\nworker\tus\t91\r\njobs\teu\t54\r\n"]
[4.020, "o", "\r\nAI MODE — describe the goal; local results are suggested, never auto-executed.\r\n"]
[4.017, "o", "\r\n> ai search show git branch status --limit 3\r\n"]
[0.302, "o", "git status                            0.033  hybrid · command\r\ngit status --short -s                 0.032  hybrid · option\r\ngit commit --amend                    0.032  hybrid · option\r\n"]
[4.015, "o", "\r\nLUA SDK — bounded extension logic for scripts and config, not a hidden mode.\r\n"]
[4.012, "o", "\r\n> eval return { answer = 6 * 7, runtime = \"sandboxed Lua 5.4\" }\r\n"]
[0.071, "o", "{\r\n  \"answer\": 42,\r\n  \"runtime\": \"sandboxed Lua 5.4\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[4.015, "o", "\r\n> check hello.lua\r\n"]
[0.051, "o", "✓ hello.lua is valid\r\n"]
[4.012, "o", "\r\nONE CATALOG — the interactive UI, CLI, docs, and agents share one contract.\r\n"]
[4.009, "o", "\r\n> describe quirl complete\r\n"]
[0.049, "o", "quirl complete <input> [--format text|json]\r\n  Query the semantic completion engine\r\n\r\nReturns the same attributed completion items used by the interactive editor.\r\n\r\nInput: Nothing\r\nOutput: Bytes\r\nLive streaming: false\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  input                    Positional `input` declared by the builtin command signature.\r\n  --format                 Choose stable text or JSON output\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  quirl complete 'git commit --am' --format json\r\n"]
[4.018, "o", "\r\nOK Tour complete. Run quirl for the full interactive shell.\r\n"]
[0.001, "x", "0"]
